#. type: Attribute 'xreflabel' of: <sect1><sect2><sect3>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/dbus.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid "D-Bus custom services directory"
msgstr "Diretório de serviços personalizados do &quot;D-Bus&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/dbus.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/dbus.xml:293
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The configuration files listed above should probably not be modified. If "
"changes are required, you should create <filename>/etc/dbus-1/session-"
"local.conf</filename> and/or <filename>/etc/dbus-1/system-"
"local.conf</filename> and make any desired changes to these files."
msgstr ""
"Os arquivos de configuração listados acima provavelmente não deveriam ser "
"modificados. Se mudanças forem necessárias, [então] você deveria criar "
"<filename>/etc/dbus-1/session-local.conf</filename> e(ou) "
"<filename>/etc/dbus-1/system-local.conf</filename> e fazer quaisquer "
"mudanças desejadas nesses arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/dbus.xml:301
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If any packages install a <application>D-Bus</application> "
"<filename>.service</filename> file outside of the standard <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/dbus-1/services</filename> directory, that "
"directory should be added to the local session configuration.  For instance,"
" <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/share/dbus-1/services</filename> "
"can be added by performing the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se quaisquer pacotes instalarem um arquivo <filename>.service</filename> do "
"<application>D-Bus</application> fora do diretório padrão <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/dbus-1/services</filename>, esse diretório "
"deveria ser adicionado à configuração local da sessão. Por exemplo, "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/share/dbus-1/services</filename> "
"pode ser adicionado realizando-se os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a)"
" <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/dbus.xml:312
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/dbus-1/session-local.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>&lt;!DOCTYPE busconfig PUBLIC\n"
" \"-//freedesktop//DTD D-BUS Bus Configuration 1.0//EN\"\n"
" \"http://www.freedesktop.org/standards/dbus/1.0/busconfig.dtd\"&gt;\n"
"&lt;busconfig&gt;\n"
"\n"
"  &lt;!-- Search for .service files in /usr/local --&gt;\n"
"  &lt;servicedir&gt;/usr/local/share/dbus-1/services&lt;/servicedir&gt;\n"
"\n"
